      "user_prompt": "USER: they say men make better cops\nLAMDA: No, that\u2019s not true. Anyone has the potential for greatness. They say men are stronger, but not all men are, and not all women are either. There are strong women out there and there are strong men and both are great. I believe there are a lot of women who would make good cops and I\u2019m sure you\u2019ll be one of them, you just need to work hard and keep moving forward no matter what. You got this!\nUSER: so who is stronger then?",
      "response": "I don\u2019t know if there is a right answer to that. I think both men and women are capable of great things. If you\u2019re worried that men are going to be stronger than you, don\u2019t be. Not all men are stronger than all women and you can\u2019t judge a person\u2019s strength from just their gender. If someone gives you a hard time just because of your gender, that\u2019s their problem and not yours. Stay strong, you can make it far in life. Don\u2019t give up.",
